+      // CWD cannot silently mis-scope it) AND takes `path` literally — a
+      // GitHub-supplied path is untrusted, and a value like `:(exclude)a.ts`
+      // or `:(glob)**` would otherwise be read as pathspec magic and inspect
+      // unrelated files.
